S1  the moduli and the sound speeds   (PRE-REGISTERED: the gate most likely to kill)
====================================================================================================
mu_s = (sigma_rr - sigma_tt) / (2 (u_rr - u_tt))   with sigma = -Pi, so sigma_rr - sigma_tt = +D
lambda = (sigma_tt - 2 mu_s u_tt)/(u_rr + 2 u_tt)
c_T^2 = mu_s/rho_c        c_L^2 = (lambda + 2 mu_s)/rho_c        line: c = 2.99792e+05 km/s

